---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact – Swim Time Converter"
  description="Get in touch with the Swim Time Converter team. Questions, feedback, or corrections about our swimming tools."
>
  <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 pb-10 pt-10 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl">Contact</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
      Found a problem, or want to suggest a feature? We read every message. Email us at{' '}
      <a href="mailto:hello@onlineswimtimeconverter.com" class="font-medium text-primary hover:underline">
        hello@onlineswimtimeconverter.com
      </a>{' '}
      or use the form below — it opens your email app with everything pre-filled.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 pb-16 sm:px-6">
    <form
      action="mailto:hello@onlineswimtimeconverter.com"
      method="post"
      enctype="text/plain"
      class="space-y-5"
    >
      <div>
        <label for="contact-subject" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-ink">
          Subject
        </label>
        <select
          id="contact-subject"
          name="subject"
          class="w-full rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-surface-1 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink shadow-sm focus:outline-2 focus:outline-primary"
        >
          <option>General question</option>
          <option>Correction or bug report</option>
          <option>Feature suggestion</option>
          <option>Partnership</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="contact-message" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-ink">
          Message
        </label>
        <textarea
          id="contact-message"
          name="body"
          rows="7"
          required
          placeholder="Tell us what you need…"
          class="w-full resize-y rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-surface-1 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink shadow-sm placeholder:text-ink-tertiary focus:outline-2 focus:outline-primary"
        ></textarea>
      </div>
      <button
        type="submit"
        class="rounded-lg bg-primary px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-on-primary shadow-sm transition-colors hover:bg-primary-hover active:bg-primary-focus"
      >
        Send via Email
      </button>
      <p class="text-xs text-ink-subtle">
        This site stores no data. Submitting the button opens your mail client — nothing is sent without your confirmation.
      </p>
    </form>

    <div class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-surface-1 p-5">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Looking for a tool instead?</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 grid gap-1.5 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <li><a href="/" class="text-sm text-ink-muted transition-colors hover:text-ink hover:underline">Swim Time Converter</a></li>
        <li><a href="/pace-calculator/" class="text-sm text-ink-muted transition-colors hover:text-ink hover:underline">Pace Calculator</a></li>
        <li><a href="/split-calculator/" class="text-sm text-ink-muted transition-colors hover:text-ink hover:underline">Split Calculator</a></li>
        <li><a href="/css-calculator/" class="text-sm text-ink-muted transition-colors hover:text-ink hover:underline">Critical Swim Speed</a></li>
        <li><a href="/interval-calculator/" class="text-sm text-ink-muted transition-colors hover:text-ink hover:underline">Interval &amp; Send-off</a></li>
        <li><a href="/lengths-converter/" class="text-sm text-ink-muted transition-colors hover:text-ink hover:underline">Lengths &amp; Distance</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-subtle">
        Still stuck? The <a href="/guides/" class="font-medium text-primary hover:underline">Guides</a> explain conversion logic step by step —
        and the <a href="/about/" class="font-medium text-primary hover:underline">About</a> page covers the method we use.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>